## Agentic Workflow

Use `/implement-orchestrator` to execute plans through the 4-phase agentic pipeline.

### Skill Entry Points

| Command | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `/implement-orchestrator` | Run the full 4-phase implementation pipeline from a plan |
| `/plan-codebase` | Generate a code specification from a plan |
| `/plan-tests` | Generate a test plan from a plan |
| `/implement-parallel` | Execute code-spec and test-plan with parallel coders |
| `/review-parallel` | Run parallel code reviews with severity-based consensus |
| `/clean-code-planner` | Apply clean code principles to a plan |

## Context Management

For long tasks, use `impl-tmp/progress.md` to track state. Use `/clear` then continue with the progress file.

